LSTM Crime Forecasting
Copyright (c) 2026 MostafaK66

This repository is a production-oriented continuation of the original private
"5G-anomaly-detection" project by MostafaK66. The executable implementation is a
daily crime-count forecasting experiment using a tuned encoder-decoder LSTM. The
original telecommunications architecture diagrams are retained as historical design
material but are not implemented by this package.

The original repository did not contain a license file. The owner has added the MIT
License to this maintained version. TensorFlow, KerasTuner, datasets, and other
dependencies retain their respective licenses and are not bundled here.
